window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Lions and Tigers and Bears (oh, my!)</b><br> <br> A steamy, swoony series set in a small town with single dads and secret shifters. Fated mates, side-splitting laughs, and sizzling romance are the perfect recipe for a happy ever after full of found family and hope.<br> <br> This collection includes six novels: <i>Dancing Bearfoot, The Tiger Next Door, Dandelion Season, Bearly Together, Broken Lynx</i>, and <i>A Green Valley Christmoose Disaster</i>, as well as a novella, seven short stories, and a collection of recipes, all in <b>duet</b> narration!</p>"; 
